ccGameHowTitle:'How this is scored',
ccGameHow:o=>['Power is one number for the game: fights and placement are rolled off it. Loot, mats, health and your calls add to it or take from it.',
  'Loot: the two best guns — rare +1, epic +2, legendary +3 each; an empty gun slot −2, each missing heal −1, no movement −1. A pack is worth −5 to +6.',
  'Mats: cap '+o.full+' (500 a stack). A circle costs '+o.early+' before zone 3 and '+o.zone+' after; farming at zone 3 adds +'+o.farm+' (surge or a fight: +'+o.short+'). What is left decides the endgame: from 90 % of the cap +1, above two thirds 0, above a third −1, below a third −'+o.pen+'.',
  'Surge: once more players are alive than the circle allows, the storm hits the squads with the lowest net damage (dealt − taken). "Farm surge" adds +'+o.surge+' to that count for −'+o.surgePow+' power.',
  'Fights: decided in '+o.decide+' % of scraps — a win is +'+o.fightPow+' and the mats off the body, a loss is death; a trade in '+o.trade+' % — −'+o.tradePow+', shield gone; the rest is shots exchanged and nothing changed.',
  'Rotation: the survival figures come from the Major 2 EU Finals replays; mats per circle are multiplied by how you leave, waiting lets you farm.'],
